  "critical_finding": "BREAKTHROUGH with TRADE-OFF: The concat_center_tfidf representation achieves the first ratio >0.5 in the fractal-map internal evaluation and nearly doubles NMI (+96.2%) on formal legal-area clustering benchmarks. However, the TF-IDF Erwaegungen component destroys cross-language invariance (cross-lang similarity drops from 0.862 to 0.038). This means concat is a powerful INTRA-LANGUAGE legal navigation tool but NOT suitable for cross-language legal navigation. Product implication: use baseline (sentence-transformer) for cross-language navigation, concat for intra-language deep legal navigation.",
